>> Animal := Ntho ncha.
>> Factory := Ntho ncha.

Animal ha-ho-fihla: ['ncha'] etsa: {
	>> animal := uena ncha.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal ha-ho-fihla: ['sound:'] etsa: { :s
	ea-hao sound := s.
}.

Animal ha-ho-fihla: ['sound'] etsa: { <- ea-hao sound.
}.

>> Dog := Ntho ncha.
>> Cat := Ntho ncha.

Dog ha-ho-fihla: ['ncha'] etsa: { <- Animal ncha sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat ha-ho-fihla: ['ncha'] etsa: { <- Animal ncha sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Sephetho ngola: Dog ncha sound, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: Cat ncha sound, mola-o-mocha.

Factory ha-ho-fihla: ['mix:and:'] etsa: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal ncha sound: (
		( beast1 sound ho-tloha: 0 bolelele: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound ho-tloha: 2 bolelele: 5 )
	).
}.

Sephetho ngola: (Factory mix: Dog ncha and: Cat ncha) sound, mola-o-mocha.
